error[E0277]: `Unnamed<Name>` does not open a subscription on `ConnectedMemoryBroker`
  --> tests/ui/subscriber_unnamed_mount.rs:21:49
   |
21 |         .with_broker(MemoryBroker::new(), |b| b.include(handle));
   |                                                 ^^^^^^^ not a subscription source for this broker
   |
   = help: the trait `SubscriptionSource<ConnectedMemoryBroker>` is not implemented for `Unnamed<Name>`
   = note: a subscriber left unnamed carries `Unnamed<..>` until the mount site names it: `b.include(handle.name("orders"))`
   = note: otherwise the source belongs to a different broker than the one being mounted on
   = help: the following other types implement trait `SubscriptionSource<C>`:
             `LocalMemorySource` implements `SubscriptionSource<ConnectedLocalMemoryBroker<CAP>>`
             `MemoryPattern` implements `SubscriptionSource<ConnectedMemoryBroker<Log>>`
             `MemorySource` implements `SubscriptionSource<ConnectedMemoryBroker<Log>>`
             `Name` implements `SubscriptionSource<C>`
             `ruststream_runtime_embassy::frames::FrameSource` implements `SubscriptionSource<ruststream_runtime_embassy::frames::FrameConnected>`
   = note: required for `Subscribing` to implement `ruststream::runtime::RouterMount<Router<MemoryBroker, ruststream::runtime::ChainHead<()>>, SubscriberBuilder<Sealed<HandleValue<Solo<Order>, (), (), (), FnBody<handle, for<'a, 'b, 'c, 'd> fn(BodyTag<handle>, &'a Order, &'b (), &'c mut ruststream::prelude::Context<'d, (), _>) -> impl Future<Output = Result<(), HandlerOutcome>> {handle::<_>}>, ruststream::runtime::Probed>>, Unnamed<Name>, (Open, Open, Open, Open)>>`
